      <p source="#source-773-837"><figure snh:figure-class="illustration" source="#source-773-835"><graphic url="fig52135_01.png" width="267px" height="243px"/><figDesc>本の図</figDesc></figure></p>
      <p source="#source-837-938"><seg source="#source-837-861">右の本を御こし可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-861-873">レ</note><seg source="#source-873-876">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-876-888">レ</note><seg source="#source-888-938">遣候。太刀のゑがかいてあるナリ。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-938-1174"><seg source="#source-938-1034">やどにてかりてあるたんすのひきだしの下タのはしのひきだしに、白ラ</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1040-1088"><seg source="#source-1034-1040">さや</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1064-1073">（鞘）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1088-1091">の</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-1103-1160"><seg source="#source-1091-1103">たんとふ</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-1133-1145">（短刀）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-1160-1174">がある。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-1174-1260"><seg source="#source-1174-1183">御こし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1183-1252"><rb><seg source="#source-1186-1189">可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1189-1201">レ</note><seg source="#source-1201-1204">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1204-1216">レ</note><seg source="#source-1216-1219">遣</seg></rb><rt>（つかはさるべく）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1252-1260">候。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1260-1295" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
        <p source="#source-1278-1295"><seg source="#source-1278-1295">才谷梅太郎</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-1295-1388"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1295-1379"><rb><seg source="#source-1298-1304">謹付</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1304-1316">二</note><seg source="#source-1316-1322">貴价</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-1322-1334">一</note></rb><rt>（つつしんできかいにふし）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1379-1388">申候。</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
